<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Benamanga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Vafilipi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa lya Pawulo kwa Vafilipi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Vafilipi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Vfp</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa lya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Vafilipi</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongochi</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo akasimbile baluwa iyi kwa vanu vevamdikie Kilisito vevagehe ku Filipi, akasimbile peakali mukiwopo mumwaka va sitini na moja peababilwe suwe Yesu Kilisito musula lya 1.13. Na yivecha chipindi peasimba baluwa iyi peakali ku mwani va Loma. Baluwa iyi ikasimbilwe kwa vanu vevamdikiye Kilisito vevakali mu mwani va Filipi. Twiwesa kwiwulanicha makani magefu kutigila mwani va Filipi mu kiganulo kya Magito gya Vanjagila. Filipi wukali mkowa mkomi va mwani va Makedonia, lyene kangi nde likali lipinga lya vanu vevamdikie Kilisito va kwanja lyelivangichwe mu mkowa mkomi lya Makedonia. Paulo na Sila nde vevakalivangiche lipinga ili lya vanu vevamdikiya Kilisito na ata kigono kimwi vakavikilwe mukiwopo na vakagonile ukoya palumiye yimwi Magito musula lya 16.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yiwoneka Paulo akali na natilo peakali isimba baluwa iyi, akatumile fwasi ilyo neke kuhongecha kwa fupo chevakali vakumlagichila pevapulike kuva avikilwe mukiwopo musula lya 4.10-19. Kangi akawesile kuvachelesa peakwikala mukiwopo na akatumiye baluwa ilyo kuvatambucha Timotewo na Epafolodito kwa lipinga lya vanu vevamdikiye Kilisito musula lya 2.19-30. Neke vawese kuvawanuka na kuvaginya ngita filongochi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegagehe</para>
  <para style="io">Pawulo ivanga kusimba baluwa lyake kwa kuhungila lipinga lya vanu vevamdikiye Kilisito vevagehe ku mwani va Filipi musula lya 1.1-2.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambele akuvalongela njowo peagehe ukoya na makani gegagehe munumbula chake musula lya 1.3—2.30.</para>
  <para style="io">Baho akavalongele malagilicho gya kugita neke vikale kwa kumdikila Kilisito kwa magito musula lya 3.1—4.9.</para>
  <para style="io">Pawulo imala kwa kuvahungila na kulihonecha lipinga lya vanu vevandikiye Kilisito lya Vafilipi kwa fupo chevamlangichile musula lya 4.10-23.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Nene Paulo pamwi na Timotewo vachulila va Yesu Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:1">Tukuvasimbila nyenye vanu vonda va Nguluvi va ukoya Filipi yemuwunganiswe na Kilisito Yesu, pamwi na filongochi na vatanga vanu vevemdikiye Kilisito.<verse eid="PHP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Tukumsuka Nguluvi Daada na Mtwa Yesu Kilisito avagavile usanzi vake na lutengamaso.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo akumhongecha Nguluvi kwakuva lya vanu vevamdikie Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Ndikumhongecha Nguluvi vangu kila pendikuvawiwuka, <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />na kila pendikuvasukila vonda, ndisuka kwa lukeduko, <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />kwakuva nyenye mkanitangile mu kasi lya kulanducha Njowo Nofu, kuvangila kila kigono kya kwanja mbaka neng'uli. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Suwe, ndichela kuva Nguluvi yeavangiche kasi iyi nofu mugati lyenu, dakuiyendelesa mbaka dapeikamilika mu kigono kila kya Kilisito Yesu, yila kigono kya kuwuya kwa mwene. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Yikuning'ang'a nene kuvahochela nyenye vonda ndeni, kwakuva ndikuvakela hilo. Nguluvi atugavile usanzi vake neke nene na nyenye tugite kasi lyake pamwi, pendiwopilwe awu pendigehe ndikuvalanduchila vanu Njowo Nofu ndi unanzi va undakyene va Nguluvi. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Nguluvi ndi yeakunilola nene, ndigehe na ludoboko lya kuvalola nyenye vonda. Ndikuvakela kwa lukelo lulula ambawo Kilisito Yesu weakuvakela nyenye.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Aga nde ndikuvasukila kwa Nguluvi, kuva mwendelele kwikela na muveche na luchelo lyonda na luhala, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />neke muwese kuhagula luchowo lwelugehe lunofu. Baho, muvecha vanofu na mwemuhela nogwa lyolyonda mu kigono kila kya Kilisito, yila kigono kya kuwuya Kilisito. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Wumi venu givecha gamemechwa makani manofu gegipatikana kwa ng'asi lya Yesu Kilisito, ago gyonda ndi kwa kuva lya kuwonesa ukomi va Nguluvi na kumnjuma.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwikala ndi Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Lukolo vangu, ndikela muchele kuva makani gyonda gendipatile gitangile hilo kulutacha Njowo Nofu. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Kuhumila na ago, vadima vonda va kaye lya ng'achale pamwi na vangi vonda vachela kuva ndigehe mukiwopo kwakuva nene ndikumgumbanikila Kilisito. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Kuwopwa kwa nene, kuvagitile vakolo volofu kumdikila Mtwa, ndeni vendeliye kugangamala mu kulanducha unanzi va Nguluvi kwa ukangafu.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Ndakyene, vanu vamonga vakumdalika Kilisito kwakuva vagehe na wifu na kwa kwipinja, ila vanu vangi vakumdalika Kilisito kwa natilo nofu. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Ndeni, ava vagita ndena kwa lukelo kwakuva vachela kuva Nguluvi andigaviye kasi iyi lya kuvalongela vanu kuva Njowo nofu ndi unanzi va undakyene va Nguluvi. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Ila ava vangi vakumlanducha Kilisito kwa ludoboko lwao na se kwa numbula mwelu, vahocha kuva vakunilutichila magudo chipindi iki kyendigehe mukiwopo.<verse eid="PHP 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Ata ndeni, kyanangike liki? Nene ndikeduka hela ata ngita vanu vakumdalika Kilisito kwa ng'asi chongofu, iveche kwa natilo nofu awu natilo wofu. Kangi dandikwendelela kukeduka, <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />ndichela kuva kwa kusuka kwenu na kwa lutango lwa Muhe va Yesu Kilisito, dandivikwa pekesu. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Ludoboko lwangu na luhuvilo lwangu kuva dandilemwa ng'odo kugita genging'ang'wa kugitwa, ila dandivecha na ukakatima hilo kila chipindi iki na hilo chipindi iki, neke kwa uwumi vangu vonda, pendivecha uwumi awu pendifuwa, ndiveche kumnjuma Kilisito. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Kwa nene, ndikwikala kwa kumgumbanikila Kilisito na kufuwa kwa nene ndi unofu hilo kuchumba kwendelela kwikala muinyi. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Ila ngita kwikala dandiwesa kugita kasi nofu hilo, suwe, sendichela ndihagule liki, kwendelela kwikala awu kufuwa! <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Ndikwegwa na makani aga gavili. Dandidoboka kuleka wumi uwu va muvili na ndihelele kwikala pamwi na Kilisito, kinu kyekinofu hilo, <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />ila kwakuva lya nyenye nde ngiba hilo nene kwendelela kwikala. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Ndigehe na undakyene va lukani ulu, ndeni, ndichela kuva dandikwendelela kwikala pamwi na nyenye vonda, neke mpate kuwongeleka na kuva na lukeduko mu kudikila. <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />Damkeduka hilo dapendivecha pamwi na nyenye kangi kuhumila na gala geagitile Kilisito Yesu neke kunitanga nene.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Suwe, lukani lukomi ndi ili mwikale ngita Njowo Nofu lya Kilisito peying'ang'a. Neke ngita ndiwesa kwacha kwa nyenye awu pendilemwilwe kufika, ndiwese ata kupulika kuva mwimile kwa ukakatima kuno mugehe na natilo yimwi. Kangi mugita kasi pamwi kwa numbula yimwi mukuvatanga vangi kudalika Njowo Nofu. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />Mbihile kuvakogopa vachindwama venu, ila muveche vakangafu figono fyonda, iyi nde yiwonesa wachi kuva vene davalemwa, nyenye damuwesa kwakuva Nguluvi yumwene ndi yeakuvagita muwese. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Kwakuva nyenye mugavilwe usanzi lya kumugumbanikila Kilisito na sekumwidikila hela, ila ata kugudiswa kwakuva lyake. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Makani agyo gyemwitovana nagyo nde gago gendikali nditovana nagyo, ngita pemukagalolole. Kangi ata nondee mpulike kuva ndikwendelela kutovana nagyo.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuvecha ngita Kilisito peagehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Wuli, wumi venu mu Kilisito ukuvagavila ludali? Wuli, lukelo lwake ukuvanamacha? Wuli, Muhe va Nguluvi agehe mugati lwenu na mwikwiwonela lusungu nyenye kwa nyenye? <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />Ngita nde peyigehe, ndemukunigite niveche na lukeduko, neke muveche na lihocho limwi, lukelo lumwi, numbula yimwi na mwikwidikile pamwi. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Mubihile kugita njowo lyolyonda kwa kwidumba, ila kwa kwikwisa, kila munu amwene muyage ndi giba hilo kuchumba yumwene. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Ubihile kuhocha pakyanya ga makani gyake yumwene, ila ayigumbanikile na njowo cha kumtanga muyage. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Mung'ang'a kugahocha makani ngita Kilisito Yesu peakali akugahocha.<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Mwene kuvangila dahile akali Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:6">ila seakahochile kuva akali ngita Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:6">ila seakalolile kuva kula kuvecha ngita Nguluvi nde kinu kya kwidumbila hilo.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Ila mwene akagalekile ago gonda akagigitile mnyigendwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">akali ngita munu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">na akawonike ngita munu.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Akayikwisile na kudikila mbaka kufuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:8">ata kufuwa pakipindilihicho.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Kwa ndena Nguluvi akamkang'icha kukyanya hilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:9">akamtambucha litawa lyeligehe likomi hilo kuchumba matawa gyonda.<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />Neke kwa uginyange va litawa lya Yesu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:10">fiwumbe fyonda fya kuluhano na muinyi na kumafunde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:10">fifugame pautalo lyake,<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />na kila munu alonge kuva Yesu Kilisito ndi Mtwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:11">kwa ukomi va Nguluvi Daada.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tung'ale ngita welu mu inyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Vakolo vangu, chipindi pendikali na nyenye mkandidikile figono fyonda na ata nondee pendigehe patali na nyenye mwendelele kwidikila. Mugite kasi kwa wogofi na kutetema kwa ulowola venu, <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />kwakuva Nguluvi nde yeagita kasi mugati lyenu, kuvagavila umwimike va kung'ang'a na kugita makani geikela Nguluvi mugagite.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Mugite finu fyonda ngajila kung'ung'ula na ngajila kukwegana, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />neke muwese kuva vanu va nofu, vevihela nongwa, ngita vana vanofu va Nguluvi vevikala mu inyi wofu na vevayagile. Mwilangala mugati lyao ngita nondwa peching'alika kuluhano, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />kangi muveche mukuvalongele vanu Njowo cha Nguluvi chechileta wumi va mbapali. Nde nene dandivecha na kwakuva lya kukeduka hilo mukigono kila kwa Kilisito, yiwoneka pawelu sendikagitile kasi hela.<verse eid="PHP 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Ata ngita dandifuwa na danda lyangu ihechwe ngita usembe va kinyuwo pamwi na usembe va ludikilo lwenu kwa Nguluvi, nene ndikeduka kangi dandihekelala pamwi na nyenye, <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Ndena ndena na nyenye mwing'ang'wa kukeduka na kuhekelela pamwi na nene.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timotewo na Epafulodito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Mukwiwunga pamwi na Mtwa Yesu ndigehe na luhuvilo kuva dandiwesa kumulagicha Timotewo kwa nyenye figono fya pepi, neke ndigangamichwe numbula kwa kupata njowo chenu. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Ndihela munu yungi yoyonda ngita Timotewo yeakuvagumbanikila kwa numbula lyake lyonda. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Vangi vakugumbanikila hela njowo chawo vavene badili lya kugungumbanikila njowo cha Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Nyenye mwavene mwichela namuna Timotewo peakali munu mnofu, kwakuva agitile kasi lya Njowo nofu pamwi na nene ngita mwana na dadie. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Ndene ndihuvilila kumlagicha kwa nyenye chipindi pendichela makani gangu pegivecha. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Na ndikuhuvilila Mtwa kuva na nene dandiwesa kwacha kwa nyenye figono fya pepi.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Ndiwene nde unofu ndimlagiche kwa nyenye lukolo vetu Epafilodito, ndi muyangu mukasi na mufita na ndi mnanzi venu yeanitangile mufinu fyending'ang'ile. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Agehe na ng'elu hilo lwa kuvalola nyenye vonda na asugwime hilo kwakuva mkapatile makani kuva mwene akali mtamwa. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Ndakyene akali mtamwa pepi kufuwa. Ila Nguluvi akamwonele lusungu, semwene hela ila ata nene neke akandigumbanikile. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Suwe, nding'ang'a hilo kumlagicha kwa nyenye, neke pemkumlola mwese kukeduka kangi na numbula lyangu yitulule. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Mumwanuke kwa lukeduko ngita lukolo mu Mtwa. Mwing'ang'wa kuvaginya vanu ngita mwene, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />kwakuva mwene akali pepi kufuwa kwakuva lya kasi lya Kilisito na akali pepi ata kufuwa neke awese kundigavila nene lutango wula wemkalemwile kunigavila.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s">Kudikila kwa Nguluvi kwa undakyene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Ndena, vakolo vangu muhekelele mukuwungana na Mtwa. Sendifwaila kugawunyila gala gendigasimbile pamwandi, kwakuva ago dagidima ludikilo lwenu. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Muyilole na Vawulanichi veviswitilicha kuva vanu vevamdikiye Kilisito ving'ang'wa vadumule bina avo vegehe ngita mikeve, ndeni mwikale patali na vevigita uwofu uwo. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Nefwe nde vene kudumula bina va undakyene, ila sevene, kwakuva nefwe tukumsuka Nguluvi kwa ng'asi lya Muhe vake na kwidumbila mukwiwunga na Kilisito Yesu, vala setukwidumbila makani gya muvili. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Ata kangi nene ndigehe na kwakuva lya kuhuvila makani gya muvili. Ngita poyoli munu yeakwilola agehe na kwakuva lya kuhuvilila makani ga mvili, nene ndigehe na molofu ga kuhuilila kuchumba mwene. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Nene ndikadumulilwe bina kigono kya mnana pendibabilwe, nene ndi munu va inyi lya Isilaeli likabila lya Benjamini, nene nde Muibulania, nde Mufalisayo kwa kukolela lagilicho lya Nguluvi gyeamgavile Musa unofu. <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />Kangi ndikagangamile hilo kugita gyendikahochile kuva gyakumkelesa hilo Nguluvi, ago nde gakandigitile ndiligudise lipinga lya vanu vevamuidikiye Kilisito. Nene ndikali ndihela nongwa mulagilicho. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Ila ago gyonda gyegakali giwoneka kuva nde ganofu, nondee, ndiwona sekinu kwakuva lya Kilisito. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Seago hela, ila gyonda ndilola sekinu, kwakuva lya makani manofu hilo, kwa kumchela Kilisito Yesu Mtwa vangu. Kwa kuva lya mwene ndilamuwe kutagila patali kila kinu, ndigawene kuva ago gyonda ni wafu hela, neke ndimupate Kilisito, <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />sendihuvila ngita kudikilwa pautalo lya Nguluvi kwa kukolela malagilicho gya Musa, ila ndihuvila kudikilwa pautalo lya Nguluvi kwa kumdikila Kilisito. Nguluvi deyeakunilola kuva ndikwidikilwa pautalo lyake kwakuva ndimdikiye Kilisito. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Kyending'ang'a ndi kumchela Kilisito na kulola ludali lwa uchulubuko vake, ndisaka kuguda ngita mwene na kufuwa ngita mwene, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />ndihuvilila kuva na nene dandichulubuchwa.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tunyila kufikila natilo lyetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Sendikwigamba kuva ndipatile suwe awu nene ndivesile suwe ndihela lukolakola. Ndikwendelela kugangamala neke niwanuke fupo ambalyo Kilisito akandigavile nene. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Lukolo vangu, sendivalila kuva ndipatile suwe fupo, ila lukani lumwi ndigita, ndikugasemwa gala gegachumbile na kugangamala kugawanuka gala gyegagehe pautalo. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Suwe, ndigehe lunyilo kufikila natilo lyangu, neke ndiwanuke lila fupo, ambalyo nde lukemelo lwa Nguluvi neke ndikale ukoya kuluwano kwa ng'asi lya Kilisito Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Nefwe vonda vetugangamale mulidikilo tung'ang'wa kuimilicha lukani lulu. Ila ngita vamonga venu vehocha lungi, suwe Nguluvi dakuvakugubutula lukani ulu. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Kinu kinofu hilo nondee, yitung'ang'a kugafwata mukwikala kwa nefwe gala Nguluvi gyeatugubutulie.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Vakolo vangu, mufwate mufano vangu. Kangi mwiwulaniche kwa vanu vevifwata mifanu gyetukavagavila nyenye. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Ndivalongiye suwe lukani ulu mala chongofu, nondee ndiwuyila kuvalongela kangi kuno kuvemba, povali vanu volofu vevipinja mawulanicho gya Yesu kufuwa pakipindilihicho. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Umalilo vao ndi kuhanangwa, kwakuva nguluvi ndi ludoboko lwa mivili, vihocha makani gyawo gya nyoni na makani gyawo gya inyi. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Ila nefwe pakaye lyetu ndi kuluhano, tukumchindila kwa ludoboko lukomi hilo Mulowa ache kuhuma kuluhano, Mtwa Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Mwene daihecha mivili gyetu misosumbafu na kuyigita iwane na mvili vake mkomi, kwa ludali lula lweiwesa kufivika finu fyonda panyi lya ulongochi vake.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="s">Paulo ihumicha malagilicho gyolofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Ndeni vakolo vangu vendikuvakela, ndidoboka hilo kuvalola, nyenye yemugehe luheko lwangu kangi ndi fupo lyangu yendigavilwe kwa kasi gyendigitile. Ndena nyenye vakolo vangu muendelele kwima kwa ukangafu kwa kumhuvilila Mtwa.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Euodia na Sunitike, ndikuvasuka hilo mupulikichane ngita lukolo mu Mutwa. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Na veve lukolo vangu mdikila ndikung'ang'a uvatange va maye vawo vapulikichane, kwakuva vagitile kasi lya kudalika Njowo nofu kwa kukangala pamwi na Kelemeti na vagita kasi vayangu vonda matawa gyawo gasimbilwe mu kiganulo kya wumi.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Suwe, muhekelele figono fyonda mukwiunga na Mtwa. Ndilonga kangi, muhekelele.<verse eid="PHP 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Ufokomasi venu uchelwe kwa vanu vonda. Mtwa yupepi kwacha. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Mbihile kuva na wogofi kwa kinu kyokyonda, ila mugyonda muveche vanu va kumsuka na kumuhongecha Nguluvi. Mumsuke gala gyemwing'ang'a kangi mumuhongiche kwa gala gyeavagitile. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Na lutengamaso lwa Nguluvi yeichumba luhala lwonda lwa vanu yidima unofu numbula na natilo lyenu mu kuwungana na Kilisito Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Kwakumalila, lukolo vangu, mukolele makani masanzi na cheching'ang'wa kunjumwa na makani gya undakyene na makani ganofu na makani gyegakumkelesa Nguluvi makani gyesegihanganika uwofu na makani gya kukelesa na gya uginyinge. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Mwendelele kugagita gala gyemuyiwulaniche na kwanuka kuhuma kwa nene, njowo chemupulike pendilonga na kangi mukagalolile pendikali ndigita. Nguluvi yeakutunemela lutengamaso daivecha pamwi na nyenye.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo akuvahongecha Vafilipi kwa fupo chawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Kwa kwiwuga na Mtwa ndipatile luheko lukomi kuva lumalilo mkapatile kangi fwasi lya kuvawonesa kuva mkundiviwuka. Kulonga undakyene muvechile mukundiviwuka figono fyonda ila semkapatile ng'asi lya kungitanga. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Sendilonga ndena kwakuva nding'ang'a lutangu kuhuma kwa yeyonda, kwakuva ndiyiwulaniche kugwita na finu fyendinafyo. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Ndichela pending'ang'a kwikala pendivecha na kinu awu pendihela. Ndiwulaniche kuvecha na finu kyokyonda chipindi kya njala awu chipindi kya kugwita na chipindi cha kuvecha na finu fyonda gyendikela awu chipindi cha kupwemukilwa finu ifyo. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Ndiwesa kugita makani ago gyonda mu Kilisito, kwakuva mwene nde yeakunigavila ludali.<verse eid="PHP 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Ila nyenye mkagitile unofu kwa kunitanga nene mumagudo gyangu. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Nyenye Vafilipi mwichela vavene kutiya pamwandi mwa kudalika Njowo Nofu, pendikali ndihega Makedonia, nyenye hela nde lipinga lya vanu vevamuidikie Kilisito nde yemunditangile, nyenye weka nde mukanitangile kuwanuka na kuvagavila vangi fyeving'ang'a. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Pendikali nding'ang'a lutango ukoya Tesalonike mkanditangile mala chongofu, vala semala imwi. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Se kuva nding'ang'a hilo kwanuka fupo, ila ndikela ndiwone mnemeliwe na Nguluvi kuchumbila kila kyemwihecha kwa lukelo lwenu. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Suwe, ndiwanuke finu fyonda fyemundigaviye, kangi ndi hilo kuchumba fyendisakile kutumila. Ndigehe na kila kinu nondee Epafolodito andiletiye suwe fupo chenu, fupo ichi ndi ngita litambiko lyakumkelesa Nguluvi yeigehe na manung'ililo manofu na iyi nde litambiko lyelikwidikilwa na kumkelesa Nguluvi. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Suwe, Nguluvi vangu kwa umosi vake mkomi kwa kuchumbila Kilisito Yesu, daavagavila finu fyonda fyemung'ang'a. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Nguluvi vetu na Daada vetu, anjumwe figono fyonda ngajila mwiso! Ndakyene.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhungilo la kumalila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Ndikuvahungila vanu vonda va Nguluvi vevakali va Kilisito Yesu. Vakolo vevagehe pamwi na nene vakuvahungila. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Vanu vonda va Nguluvi vakuvahungila, hilo vala vanu va Nguluvi vevagehe mukaye lya ng'achale Kaisali.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Ndikumsuka Nguluvi Daada na Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito avagavile usanzi vake.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>